NC Digital builds custom ecommerce websites for Cardiff businesses — fully designed around your brand, built to convert visitors into paying customers. Whether you're launching your first online store or replacing an underperforming one, we'll build something that works.

Ecommerce sites start from **£800**. The price depends on your chosen platform, the size of your product catalogue, and any specific functionality you need.

## Ecommerce platforms for Cardiff businesses

We recommend the right platform for your business and then build a store that's fully custom-designed — not a theme with your logo dropped in.

**Shopify** — fast, scalable, and low-maintenance. Perfect for Cardiff retailers and product businesses that want a professional store without the technical overhead. Custom-designed from the ground up.

**WooCommerce** — built on WordPress, giving you complete flexibility. Great if you already have a WordPress site or need functionality that goes beyond what Shopify offers out of the box. Every WooCommerce store we build is custom-designed.

**SureCart** — ideal for digital products, courses, subscriptions, or any Cardiff business that wants to take payments online without managing a full product catalogue. Fully custom-designed.

## What's included

Every ecommerce build we deliver to Cardiff clients includes:

- Fully custom design tailored to your brand — no templates
- Mobile-first layout — Cardiff shoppers browse on their phones
- Secure checkout and payment gateway integration
- Product management system you can use yourself after launch
- On-page SEO for product and category pages
- Google Analytics and conversion tracking set up from day one

